<title>PHILIPPINES: Filsyn to venture into property development.</title>
<headline>Filsyn to venture into property development.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polyester fibre producer Filsyn Corp said on Friday its board had approved a joint venture project to develop a golf course in northern Philippines.</p>
<p>The proposed golf course would be built on a 70-hectare tract of land, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
